# Bridge account: publishes records/events/status, reads acks and data requests for itself only
user frb01
topic write utility/site01/+/dfr/#
topic write utility/site01/bridge/frb01/status
topic write utility/site01/bridge/frb01/health
topic write utility/site01/bridge/frb01/response
topic read utility/site01/bridge/frb01/ack
topic read utility/site01/bridge/frb01/request

# Control-center / EMS integration account: reads everything for the site, writes acks and requests
user ems
topic read utility/site01/#
topic write utility/site01/bridge/+/ack
topic write utility/site01/bridge/+/request
